test.yaml:11:15: run-gemini-cli does not check who started it, and this workflow runs on "issue_comment", which anyone can cause on a public repository. the text they write steers the agent, which has the secrets of the job. the environment "staging" of job "staging" has no required reviewers, so no one has to approve the run. restrict the job with an if: on github.event.comment.author_association (OWNER, MEMBER or COLLABORATOR) or on a label that only maintainers add, run it in an environment with required reviewers, or limit the agent to the few tools it needs [agentic-actions]
